# Internal APIs are NOT frontend APIs. They are blocked on localhost:8080.
# Run these only from a REST client INSIDE the Compose network, using the service
# hostname. Ordinary VS Code on the host cannot resolve these names.
# Do not publish service ports or pass the service token to the browser to work around this.
@tenantBase = http://tenant:8000
@meteringBase = http://metering:8000
@serviceToken = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_SERVICE_TOKEN
@contractId = REPLACE_WITH_CONTRACT_UUID
@roomId = REPLACE_WITH_ROOM_UUID

### Billing input snapshot
GET {{tenantBase}}/internal/v1/contracts/{{contractId}}/billing-context
X-Service-Token: {{serviceToken}}

### Meter pair for a room
GET {{meteringBase}}/internal/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/meters
X-Service-Token: {{serviceToken}}

### Confirmed cutoff projection
GET {{meteringBase}}/internal/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/cutoffs?page=1&page_size=100
X-Service-Token: {{serviceToken}}
